<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 05:11:00 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>从被认为有利于地外通信的区域检测到的 25 个无线电信号</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/25-radio-signals-detected-from-a-region-considered-favorable-for-extraterrestrial-communication</link><description>天文学家已经确定&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 05:10:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/25-radio-signals-detected-from-a-region-considered-favorable-for-extraterrestrial-communication</guid></item><item><title>血液测试可能揭示哪些淋巴瘤患者会对免疫治疗产生反应</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/blood-test-may-reveal-which-lymphoma-patients-will-respond-to-immunotherapy</link><description>在丹娜—法伯癌症研究所接受了强效细胞疗法的 91 名淋巴瘤患者中，那些在治疗前血液中携带特定基因表达特征的患者出现癌症进展的可能性要小得多。康奈尔大学和丹娜法伯癌症研究所的一项新研究显示，该特征得分高的患者比得分低的患者进展风险低 80%。这&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 04:55:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/blood-test-may-reveal-which-lymphoma-patients-will-respond-to-immunotherapy</guid></item><item><title>在上盂唇插入处使用单个缝合锚进行 SLAP 修复后的早期功能结果</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/early-functional-outcomes-after-slap-repair-with-a-single-suture-anchor-at-the-superior-labral-insertion</link><description>氧&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 04:40:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/early-functional-outcomes-after-slap-repair-with-a-single-suture-anchor-at-the-superior-labral-insertion</guid></item><item><title>试验发现，立即冠状动脉造影无法提高心脏骤停后的生存率</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/immediate-coronary-angiography-fails-to-boost-survival-after-cardiac-arrest-trial-finds</link><description>急性冠脉综合征是院外心脏骤停 (OHCA) 的常见原因。对于心电图显示 ST 段抬高的 OHCA 患者，建议立即进行冠状动脉造影以评估动脉阻塞，必要时随后进行经皮冠状动脉介入治疗 (PCI) 以恢复血流。然而，在无 ST 段抬高的患者中使用冠状动脉造影的证据有限。&lt;img src="https://www.escardio.org/events/congresses/esc-congress/" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 04:25:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/immediate-coronary-angiography-fails-to-boost-survival-after-cardiac-arrest-trial-finds</guid></item><item><title>受“献给阿尔吉农的鲜花”的启发，实验性滴鼻剂可改善小鼠的记忆力</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/inspired-by-flowers-for-algernon-experimental-nose-drops-improve-memory-in-mice</link><description>查尔斯·帕金斯中心格雷格·尼利教授实验室的这项研究将带来一种治疗大脑疾病的新方法，从而可以开发针对主要神经系统疾病的药物，包括神经退行性疾病、中风、创伤性脑损伤以及罕见的遗传和发育疾病。&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 04:10:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/inspired-by-flowers-for-algernon-experimental-nose-drops-improve-memory-in-mice</guid></item><item><title>果蝇研究表明跳跃基因可能有助于构建更加多样化的大脑</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/jumping-genes-may-help-build-a-more-diverse-brain-fruit-fly-study-reveals</link><description>科学家们已经知道，这些可移动的 DNA 片段，即转座元件 (TE)，在塑造动物基因组方面发挥着重要作用，有时甚至成为基因产生的 RNA 信息的一部分。但新的研究表明，这种情况在大脑中发生得特别频繁，可能为脑细胞提供另一种产生更多种类蛋白质的方法。&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 03:55:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/jumping-genes-may-help-build-a-more-diverse-brain-fruit-fly-study-reveals</guid></item><item><title>使用 β 配对靶向射频扩散改进蛋白质结合剂设计</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/improved-protein-binder-design-using-%ce%b2-pairing-targeted-rfdiffusion</link><description>这项研究展示了深度学习蛋白质设计模型在生成功能验证的 β 链配对界面、扩展从头结合蛋白和可访问目标表面的结构多样性方面的能力。&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 03:40:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/improved-protein-binder-design-using-%ce%b2-pairing-targeted-rfdiffusion</guid></item><item><title>开发者使用 Claude 代码构建全自动 3D 体育联盟，模拟 30 支球队和 38 年历史</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/developer-uses-claude-code-to-build-a-fully-automated-3d-sports-league-with-30-teams-and-38-years-of-simulated-history</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 03:25:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/developer-uses-claude-code-to-build-a-fully-automated-3d-sports-league-with-30-teams-and-38-years-of-simulated-history</guid></item><item><title>物理学家通过控制单个原子的磁心来打破预期</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/physicists-defy-expectations-by-controlling-the-magnetic-heart-of-a-single-atom</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 03:10:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/physicists-defy-expectations-by-controlling-the-magnetic-heart-of-a-single-atom</guid></item><item><title>我们是宇宙认识自身的方式吗？与布莱恩·考克斯</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/are-we-the-universes-way-of-knowing-itself-with-brian-cox</link><description>前往&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 02:55:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/are-we-the-universes-way-of-knowing-itself-with-brian-cox</guid></item></channel></rss>